{
  "name": "Jev: support inbox routing",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Support inbox routing\nJev reads each email once and answers three questions: which **team**, is it **urgent**, does it ask for a **refund**.\n\nConfident answers go straight to the team queue. Anything Jev is unsure about goes to a person.\n\nReplace **Sample inbox** with your email trigger and the queue nodes with your helpdesk.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b924f848-c9ec-5d44-ad33-38ac77426dd5",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "d2a6a5f0-f48e-5ab1-a84c-11d2e0ef60fe",
      "name": "Try with sample data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Invented sample data. In production, replace this node with your real trigger.\nreturn [\n  {\n    \"from\": \"maya@greenleaf.example\",\n    \"subject\": \"Charged twice this month\",\n    \"body\": \"Our card shows two charges of $49 for October. Please refund the duplicate.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"from\": \"ops@harbourcafe.example\",\n    \"subject\": \"Locked out before payroll\",\n    \"body\": \"Nobody can sign in since we turned on single sign-on, and payroll for 22 staff has to go out by 2pm today.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"from\": \"li.wei@northfield.example\",\n    \"subject\": \"Bank feed stopped\",\n    \"body\": \"The bank feed has not imported anything since Friday. Month end is in two weeks so no panic.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"from\": \"sam@brightpath.example\",\n    \"subject\": \"Pricing for 40 seats\",\n    \"body\": \"We are comparing tools. What would 40 users on annual billing cost, and do you have a nonprofit price?\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"from\": \"finance@atlasbuild.example\",\n    \"subject\": \"Question\",\n    \"body\": \"Can you help with the thing from last week? Same as before.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"from\": \"jo@riverside.example\",\n    \"subject\": \"Exports and a refund?\",\n    \"body\": \"The CSV export cuts off at 10,000 rows, and since we cannot use it, can we get some money back for this month?\"\n  }\n].map((json) => ({ json }));"
      },
      "id": "02273db2-eaff-5b5a-a5df-a81e7b7231e7",
      "name": "Sample inbox",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "askSeveral",
        "stateSource": "expression",
        "state": "=Subject: {{ $json.subject }}\n\n{{ $json.body }}",
        "questions": {
          "question": [
            {
              "key": "team",
              "type": "choice",
              "instructions": "Which team should handle this customer email?",
              "criteria": "billing: An existing customer’s own subscription: charges, refunds, invoices or receipts from us, payment methods, plan changes, tax details on our invoices\ntechnical: The product not working or how to use a feature: errors, bugs, outages, slowness, bank feeds, imports, exports, reports, integrations, payroll calculations\naccount: Access and users: logging in, passwords, two-factor, single sign-on, adding or removing users, roles and permissions, account ownership, security of the login\nsales: Someone who has not bought yet or wants a new contract: pricing questions before buying, quotes, demos, trials, discounts for new deals, partner or reseller programs",
              "threshold": 0,
              "gate": true
            },
            {
              "key": "urgent",
              "type": "noul",
              "instructions": "Does this email need a reply within a few hours: the customer is blocked from working right now, reports a security problem, or faces a deadline today or by tomorrow morning?",
              "criteria": "yes: Blocked now, a security problem, or a deadline today or by tomorrow morning\nno: An inconvenience, a question, or a deadline that is days or weeks away",
              "threshold": 0,
              "gate": true
            },
            {
              "key": "refund",
              "type": "noul",
              "instructions": "Does the customer ask for money back (a refund, a credit or a reversed charge)?",
              "criteria": "",
              "threshold": 0,
              "gate": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "threshold": 0.8,
        "additionalOptions": {
          "includeAudit": true,
          "redactPersonalData": true
        }
      },
      "id": "69cdcbd9-63d1-5330-ade5-10215d7bae81",
      "name": "Jev Decision",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-jev.jevDecision",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "typeSafeApi": {
          "id": "jevTypeSafeCred1",
          "name": "TypeSafe account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
